EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. To find out more about your options for transferring to ASU to complete your BSN (https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu/degree-programs/undergraduate/nursing-bsn), I recommend that you attend an in-person or online BSN information session. Following the session (https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu/admissions/information-sessions/), you will be provided with next steps and contact information for the College of Nursing and Health Innovation’s recruitment and advising offices. Nursing is a unique degree within ASU, so I recommend connecting directly with a representative of this program after your information session.


If you have any additional questions about the requirements or structure, you can email nursingandhealth@asu.edu or call 602-496-0937.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
